    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Continue the construction of Marketing outlets in Chitwan, Kavre, Nuwakot, Ratnanagar and Bennighat Rorang = #5
2.	Cold room installation for Marketing outlets in Chitwan, Kavre, Nuwakot, Ratnanagar and Benighat Rorang = #4
3.	Input support (Crates) to Cooperatives and DCUs =#6 (districts)
4.	Support Business Plan Development of (18) primary cooperatives and Market outlets of Chabahil and Benighat Rorang = # 20
5.	Mid Term Review of CMDP = # 1
6.	Operation of additional Markets (Benighat Rorang) = #1
7. Piloting a model intervention to promote diversification of agriculture products for improving livelihoods in CMDP project districts (within and adjoining CMDP municipalities) and link to the CMDP market</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Marketing outlet in Nuwakot and Benighat is in last stage of construction. Remaining 3 marketing outlets construction is ongoing
2. Installed 8 cold room for 4 primary cooperatives 
3. 6,960 crates supported to cooperatives and DCUs
4. Supported for preparation of 20 business plan
5. Mid term review completed 
6. Benighat Rorang market is in operation
7. The project has supported for the construction of marketing outlets for dairy products in Chitwan and Makwanpur districts</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Construct (6) cooperative markets at district and municipal level
2. Install (6) cooling chamber at collection centers built
3. Support (13) cooperatives and market centers with transportation vehicle support
4. 15,000 farmers benefitted from marketing facilities support.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">4 Agreements (LoAs and RPA) signed and work is undergoing
8 Cooling Chambers installed
Procurement of 25 Vehicles is in the process
A total of 19,331 farmers (female-9931; male-9400) benefitted from marketing facilities support. As a result, they were able to sold 8,590.20 Tons of Fruits and Vegetables worth NPR 193,668,913.50.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
